		<svg class="hero-menu-icon" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
			<path d="M62 505.96630859c0-0.63544922 0.63544922-1.90546875 0.63544922-2.54003906 3.17548828-16.51464844 11.43193359-29.21748047 26.04023437-37.47392578 6.35185547-3.8109375 13.33828125-5.08183594 20.32470703-5.71640625H906.74316406c17.78378906 0 31.12207031 7.621875 41.28486328 21.59472656 7.62099609 10.79736328 10.79736328 22.23017578 9.52734375 35.56845703-2.54091797 20.32382813-16.51464844 38.10849609-37.47392578 43.18945313-5.71640625 1.27001953-11.4328125 1.90546875-17.78378906 1.90546875H113.44677734c-20.96015625 0-34.93300781-10.16279297-45.09492187-27.31113281-3.17636719-5.08095703-4.44638672-10.79736328-5.71640625-16.51464844 0-0.63457031-0.63544922-1.90458984-0.63544922-2.54003906v-10.16191407zM62 242.38144531c0-0.63544922 0.63544922-1.90546875 0.63544922-2.54091797 3.17548828-16.51376953 11.43193359-29.21660156 26.04023437-37.47392578 6.35185547-3.81005859 13.33828125-5.08007813 20.32470703-5.71552734H906.74316406c17.78378906 0 31.12207031 7.62099609 41.28486328 21.59472656 7.62099609 10.79736328 10.79736328 22.23017578 9.52734375 35.56757813-2.54091797 20.32470703-16.51464844 38.109375-37.47392578 43.18945312-5.71640625 1.27089844-11.4328125 1.90634766-17.78378906 1.90634766H113.44677734c-20.96015625 0-34.93300781-10.16279297-45.09492187-27.31113281-3.17636719-5.08183594-4.44638672-10.79736328-5.71640625-16.51464844 0-1.27001953-0.63544922-2.54003906-0.63544922-3.17548828v-9.52734375zM107.09492188 820.3625c-1.27001953 0-1.90546875-0.63457031-3.17548829-0.63457031-14.60742188-3.17636719-24.77021484-11.4328125-32.39208984-24.13564453-5.71640625-9.52734375-8.25732422-19.68925781-7.621875-30.4875 1.90546875-21.59472656 17.14921875-40.64941406 39.37851562-45.72949219 4.44726563-1.27089844 9.52734375-1.27089844 14.60917969-1.27089844h790.75458985c17.14921875 0 30.48662109 7.621875 40.64941406 20.96015625 6.35097656 8.89189453 10.16191406 19.68925781 10.16191406 30.48662109 0 12.70283203-4.44550781 24.13476563-12.70283203 33.66210938-8.25644531 9.52734375-